<title>USA: Springs says in midst of cost reductions.</title>
<headline>Springs says in midst of cost reductions.</headline>
<dateline>FORT MILL, S.C. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Springs Industries Inc said it is in the midst of making investments and changes to reduce costs, improve quality and service and boost productivity.</p>
<p>The company said that these investments and changes were a &quot;transitional effect&quot; that contributed to the lower fourth-quarter results it reported Tuesday.</p>
<p>The company said Tuesday it earned $0.51 per share compared with $1.30 in the year-ago period.</p>
<p>The company was not specific as to the nature of the investments and changes.</p>
</text>
